The agreement specifies that plots are allocated according to the rule that each party receives one plot in the order of their registration on the register. Each plot is exactly forty square metres in size. This allocation rule ensures an orderly distribution among parties involved, and the fixed plot size maintains fairness and consistency in the allocation process.

